# Goes in the printvault.magikh0e.pl docroot, nothing else does.
#
# The site moved to printery.magikh0e.com when the app was renamed. This keeps
# every old address working: the GitHub README links, the YouTube description,
# the reel, anything anyone bookmarked, and the inbound links from magikh0e.pl
# that took weeks to get crawled in the first place.
#
# Permanent, and path preserving, so /guide.html lands on /guide.html rather
# than dumping everyone on the home page, which is what tells a search engine
# the pages moved rather than vanished.
#
# Leave this in place indefinitely. It costs nothing and the day it is removed
# is the day those links start 404ing.

RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://printery.magikh0e.com/$1 [R=301,L,QSA]
